# __LABEL__ system instructions

This system renders prototype views with its own Vue app (`app.ts`) and stylesheet (`styles/theme.css`). Follow the repository's working context.

- Read the documents in [context/](context/) that apply to the task before designing with this system.
- Use the task procedures in [skills/](skills/): each folder's `SKILL.md` says when it applies.
- Documented components live in `components/<name>/`, each with a Markdown page.
- To set the system up, use the platform's `setup-design-system` skill.
